# v1.0.5

## Required Environment

- Game patch: FFXIV 7.57
- Dalamud: v15.0.3.7 (API 15)

## Changelog

### New Features

- **Chat commands.** `/drakos market start`, `/drakos orders start`, `/drakos orders resume`, `/drakos craft <item>` and `/drakos gather <item>` start runs from chat or a macro, and Drakos answers each one in chat. A command Drakos does not know prints the full list. (`4f7fbef05`, `79375c78d`)
- **Unlock every crafter and gatherer.** `/drakos unlockall` does each crafting and gathering class's guild quests and first class quest, and saves a gearset for it. (`b41a3b7ea`, `de4799235`)
- **Retainers tab in the desktop app.** See each retainer's gil, listings and venture timers, withdraw all gil, set venture material goals, edit the market watchlist and run an undercut sweep. (`fb37f5659`, `c2d9b700d`)

### Improvements

- When Drakos hands items to an NPC for leves, Potkin or Splendors exchanges, it never gives away a copy one of your gearsets uses or one with materia melded, and it can hand over copies from the Armoury Chest. (`eae4ab529`, `c152d3f27`)
- You can click the resting sign over your character to hide it. (`428f54b40`)
- The Saddlebag storage setting is greyed out until you finish My Feisty Little Chocobo. (`826647c9c`)

### Fixes

- Inventory space settings now do what the Settings window says. With automatic clearing off, Drakos clears no space, each storage method runs only when ticked, and a failed clearing is retried after a minute instead of half an hour. (`97a22a543`, `88294b4ea`)
- FATE farming fights back against monsters that attack between FATEs, and finds a landing spot when a flight into a FATE ends in mid-air instead of stopping the farm. (`d928281da`, `b01e27cff`)
- Miner and Botanist orders turn on Prospect or Triangulate when it is off, so they find their nodes. (`86c8b5854`)
- An order for an item found only at rocky outcrops or lush vegetation now stops with a message when the Miner or Botanist has no off-hand tool, instead of trying the node again and again. (`4d866efcb`)
- Leve orders get past a levemete's first-visit explanation pages, and stop instead of pressing anything when the leve menu is gone. (`e2bd1935e`, `aa2ff3d59`)
- Starting a run while a synthesis is still in progress now asks you to finish or quit it instead of pressing anything. (`67fd719e1`)
- Eating a meal while another meal is still active no longer counts as a failure. (`4cc552ea9`)
- Buying gear and other items that do not stack from a vendor no longer gets stuck. (`7aba390c8`)
- A low-level crafter asked for quality now reaches the quality it can instead of failing. (`6325aa526`)
- Aethernet trips retry when the game drops the interaction. (`97a22a543`)
- Retainer sweep log lines name the item instead of showing its ID number. (`97ac40258`)
- The desktop app no longer misses quick step changes in its gathering, world visit and crafting readouts, and the order composer's title no longer gets cut off. (`171c6f456`, `e8b1855a4`)

### Infrastructure

- Drakos runs on patch 7.57 and Dalamud 15.0.3.7. (`df0d46b22`)

### In progress

- Cosmic Exploration runs, Ishgard Restoration runs, Leveling to level 5 and Custom Deliveries now have their own tabs, marked work in progress. Custom Deliveries hand-ins have not been tested in the game yet. Grand Company supply deliveries, field gathering leves, gear leves, leveling past level 5 and listing new items from the saddlebag are still being built, and the Selling panel's saddlebag listing option still does nothing. (`a616e73a9`, `caedbcd65`)
